{"type":"data","nodes":[{"type":"data","data":[{"debug":1},true],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"zotero":1,"inscriptions":7,"isBulletin":654},{"title":2,"author":3,"date":4,"citation":5,"uri":6},"Sicile","Orsi","1896","\u003Cspan>Paolo Orsi, « Sicile », \u003Ci>Bulletin de Correspondance Hellénique\u003C/i> 20 (1896): 399‑400\u003C/span>","https://www.zotero.org/groups/isicily/items/FWX5CWBN",[8,137,199,301,377,452],{"file":9,"uri":9,"title":10,"status":11,"editions":13,"editionAuthor":24,"type":25,"objectType":29,"material":33,"condition":40,"layoutDesc":41,"handNote":48,"date":64,"places":69,"geo":79,"country":74,"provenance":71,"provenanceGeo":83,"region":86,"settlement":87,"repository":88,"idno":92,"textLang":95,"tmNumber":40,"facsimile":99,"letterHeights":106,"publications":110,"zotero":114,"keywords":118,"html":129,"bibl":130,"bulletinDateSort":136,"citedRangeSort":131,"languageSort":96,"materialSort":34,"typeSort":26},"ISic001869","Funerary inscription for Artemo",{"_":12},"edited",[14,16,18,20,22],{"type":15},"TM",{"type":17},"EDR",{"type":19},"EDH",{"type":21},"EDCS",{"type":23},"PHI",null,{"_":26,"ana":27,"ref":28},"funerary","#function.funerary","https://ontology.inscriptiones.org/type_of_inscription/Funerary",{"_":30,"ana":31,"ref":32},"block","#object.block","http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/objtyp/lod/189.html",{"_":34,"ana":35,"type":36,"subtype":37,"ref":39},"limestone","#material.inorganic.stone.sedimentary_rock.limestone","stone.limestone",[38],"unverified","http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/material/lod/66.html","",{"layout":42},{"p":43,"rs":44,"damage":40},"Three lines of Greek letters, seemingly not centered / regularly laid out.",{"_":45,"ana":46,"ref":47},"chiselled","#execution.chiselled","http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/1",{"lettering":49,"dimensions":50},"Described by Orsi (1896) as 'scritto a pessimi caratteri', and (1899) as 'lettere cattive, rustiche cosi che a tutta prima sembrano archaiche, e molto sconservate... L'iscrizione negligentemente redatta e scolpita è funebre di tarda età'. Pace states 'lettere del III sec. av. Cr.', but given the presence of lunate epsilon and Orsi's comments, a later date seems much more likely.",[51,60],{"type":52,"l":53,"from":54,"to":55,"h":56,"unit":57,"atLeast":58,"atMost":59},"letterHeight","Line 1-3","line1","line3","55-95","mm","55","95",{"type":61,"l":62,"from":54,"to":63,"unit":57},"interlinear","Interlineation line 1 to 2","line2",{"_":65,"notBefore":66,"notAfter":67,"evidence":68},"Suggested to be of later Roman date by Orsi on the basis of lettering, but the only possible indicator is the lunate epsilon, which offers little help; the text could on the basis of names, formulae, and lettering date anywhere between late Hellenistic and later Roman.",101,400,"lettering",[70,75],{"_":71,"type":72,"ref":73,"region":74},"Kamarina","ancient","http://pleiades.stoa.org/places/462126","Sicilia",{"_":76,"type":77,"ref":78,"region":74},"Santa Croce Camerina","modern","http://sws.geonames.org/6540853",[80],[81,82],36.8736,14.4507,[84,85],36.8759983,14.4377781,"Sicily","Siracusa",{"_":89,"role":90,"ref":91},"Museo Archeologico Regionale Paolo Orsi","museum","http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/museum/097",{"_":93,"type":94},"16474","inventory",{"_":96,"mainLang":97,"languages":98},"Ancient Greek","grc",[96],{"n":100,"url":101,"height":102,"width":103,"desc":104,"surfaceType":105},"screen","ISic001075_tiled.tif","2268px","4032px","I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2026-09-17","front",[107],{"atLeast":108,"atMost":109},55,95,[111,112,113],"Orsi, 1896, Sicile","Orsi, 1899, Camarina (Campagna archeologica del 1896)","Pace, 1927, Camarina: topografia, storia, archeologia",[115,116,117],"FWX5CWBN","ICW2M9P2","ZJ6KUFMM",[119,120,121,26,30,34,122,123,124,125,126,127,128,97],"isic001869","funerary inscription for artemo",{"_":1